Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.66,0:00:06.21,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}6{\fs68}次交手 一场没赢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.26,0:00:07.67,TL,,0,0,0,,世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68}？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.67,0:00:10.63,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}6{\fs68}次撞上她 {\fs78}6{\fs68}次全输
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.31,0:00:18.21,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And a reaction to match, Jelena Ostapenko!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N赛点拿下 看奥斯塔彭科的反应！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.56,0:00:21.49,TL,,0,0,0,,最痛的一次 二零二三美网
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.49,0:00:24.27,TL,,0,0,0,,卫冕冠军 世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.36,0:00:26.40,TL,,0,0,0,,她先拿一盘 然后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.40,0:00:28.70,TL,,0,0,0,,奥斯塔彭科提速了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.36,0:00:32.20,TL,,0,0,0,,奥斯塔彭科说 我打得又快又狠
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.20,0:00:33.87,TL,,0,0,0,,她就有麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.16,0:00:37.65,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜盘 {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.31,0:00:46.31,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Game, set, Jelena Ostapenko stuns number one.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N奥斯塔彭科爆冷击败世界第一！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.56,0:00:49.52,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}75{\fs68}周的王座 到此为止
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.52,0:00:52.92,TL,,0,0,0,,她说 突然间 我失去了控制
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.16,0:00:56.73,TL,,0,0,0,,武汉这一周 两人分处两个半区
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.41,0:01:04.91,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And the final point goes Iga Swiatek's way.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N最后一分 属于斯瓦泰克
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.16,0:01:08.16,TL,,0,0,0,,克星续写 还是破局？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.36,0:01:10.61,TL,,0,0,0,,第七次 你押谁？
